    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "either:  (i) the individual has consented to the use or disclosure of the information for that purpose; or  (ii) it is impracticable to obtain that consent";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "Direct marketing is permitted within this temporal interval.";
