    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Temporal interval until which direct marketing is not permitted.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "the organisation provides a simple means by which the individual may easily request not to receive direct marketing communications from the organisation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "Direct marketing is not permitted after this temporal interval.";
