    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "in each direct marketing communication with the individual:  (i) the organisation includes a prominent statement that the individual may make such a request; or  (ii) the organisation otherwise draws the individual’s attention to the fact that the individual may make such a request";
