    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "implies";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Conditional obligation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) a credit provider has disclosed default information about an individual to a credit reporting body; and (b) on a day after the default information was disclosed, the amount of the overdue payment to which the information relates is paid;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "payment information about the individual is a statement that the amount of the overdue payment has been paid on that day.";
