    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) a mortgage insurer or trade insurer holds or held personal information about an individual; and (b) the information was disclosed to the insurer by a credit reporting body or credit provider under Division 2 or 3 of this Part;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the prohibition applies until the information is deleted or updated.";
