    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) This section applies if:  (a) either:  (i) a civil penalty order has been made against an entity for a contravention of a civil penalty provision (other than section 13G); or  (ii) an entity is found guilty of an offence against this Part; and  (b) a person has suffered, or is likely to suffer, loss or damage (including injury to the person’s feelings or humiliation) as a result of the contravention or commission of the offence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) This section applies if:  (a) either:  (i) a civil penalty order has been made against an entity for a contravention of a civil penalty provision (other than section 13G); or  (ii) an entity is found guilty of an offence against this Part; and  (b) a person has suffered, or is likely to suffer, loss or damage (including injury to the person’s feelings or humiliation) as a result of the contravention or commission of the offence.";
